<title>GERMANY: Karstadt 9-mth turnover unchanged.</title>
<headline>Karstadt 9-mth turnover unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30. (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>Sales by operating group</p>
<p>	Karstadt			    10,905 (+12.7 pct)</p>
<p>	Hertie				 3,682 (-12.9 pct)</p>
<p>	Neckermann			   3,666 (+4.6 pct)</p>
<p>	NUR				    3,816 (+5.2 pct)</p>
<p>    Less internal sales		  1,567</p>
<p>    Less intermediary sales	    1,380</p>
<p>    Total group sales inc VAT	 19,123 (unchanged)</p>
<p>NOTE -- Karstadt AG is a German retail group.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
